  "html": "<p>Passive <a href=\"/wiki/Skills\" title=\"Skills\">skills</a> have special effects that are active as long as you have them placed on your skill bar. Some of the passive skills available help define your character's class in the game. For example, a Warrior would be more likely to use Gym Freak and Way of the Roo to increase health and Melee attack speed rather than Bookworm or Mental Prowess which affect the power of a magic caster. Wards are not class specific and are helpful if you are in an area dominated by monsters of a specific element.\n</p><p><br/>\n<small>This list is sortable. Click the button next to the heading you wish to sort by. A 2 column sort is also possible, by first sorting one column then the second. </small>\n</p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"sortable\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"unsortable\">Icon\n</th><th>Skill Name\n</th><th>Class\n</th><th class=\"unsortable\"># of Ranks\n</th><th class=\"unsortable\">Description\n</th><th>Level First Available\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Awesome-cleavage.png\" title=\"Image:Awesome-cleavage.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Awesome-cleavage.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Awesome-cleavage.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Awesome_Cleavage\" title=\"Awesome Cleavage\">Awesome Cleavage</a>\n</td><td>Fighter\n</td><td>14\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Powers up the Skill Cleave with additional damage and chance to Knockdown\n</td><td>35\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Banner-of-the-foolish-bravery.png\" title=\"Image:Banner-of-the-foolish-bravery.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Banner-of-the-foolish-bravery.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Banner-of-the-foolish-bravery.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Banner_of_Foolish_Bravery\" title=\"Banner of Foolish Bravery\">Banner of Foolish Bravery</a>\n</td><td>Fighter\n</td><td>5\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Increases Fear Resistance\n</td><td>25\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Divine-ward.png\" title=\"Image:Skill-_Divine-ward.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Skill-_Divine-ward.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Divine-ward.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Ward\" title=\"Divine Ward\">Divine Ward</a>\n</td><td>Fighter\n</td><td>15\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Raise Divine Resistance, Decrease ALL other resistances\n</td><td>30\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Gym-freak.png\" title=\"Image:Gym-freak.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Gym-freak.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Gym-freak.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Gym_Freak\" title=\"Gym Freak\">Gym Freak</a>\n</td><td>Fighter\n</td><td>1\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">+50% Health per END, +5 STR and AGI, -25% Mana per INT, -10% Ranged Attack Speed, -5 END and INT\n</td><td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/I'm_Rubber_You're_Screwed.jpg\" title=\"Image:I'm_Rubber_You're_Screwed.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:I'm_Rubber_You're_Screwed.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/I'm_Rubber_You're_Screwed.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/I'm_Rubber,_You're_Screwed\" title=\"I'm Rubber, You're Screwed\">I'm Rubber, You're Screwed</a>\n</td><td>Fighter\n</td><td>1\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Shield Skill.  Chance to knockdown opponent when blocking melee attack.\n</td><td>25\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Mad_Melee_Mastery.jpg\" title=\"Image:Mad_Melee_Mastery.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Mad_Melee_Mastery.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Mad_Melee_Mastery.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Mad_Melee_Mastery\" title=\"Mad Melee Mastery\">Mad Melee Mastery</a>\n</td><td>Fighter\n</td><td>5\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Increases Melee Attack Rating, Reduces Health by 20%\n</td><td>30\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Way-of-the-roo.png\" title=\"Image:Way-of-the-roo.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Way-of-the-roo.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Way-of-the-roo.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Way_of_the_Roo\" title=\"Way of the Roo\">Way of the Roo</a>\n</td><td>Fighter\n</td><td>1\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">+25% Melee Attack Speed, -7% Range Attack Speed, -5% to all Magic Damage\n</td><td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Barf-O-Rama.png\" title=\"Image:Barf-O-Rama.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Barf-O-Rama.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Barf-O-Rama.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Barf-O-Rama\" title=\"Barf-O-Rama\">Barf-O-Rama</a>\n</td><td>Ranger\n</td><td>10\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Chance to induce barfing on target and nearby.  Poison damage.\n</td><td>37\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Average-bmi.png\" title=\"Image:Average-bmi.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Average-bmi.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Average-bmi.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Average_BMI\" title=\"Average BMI\">Average BMI</a>\n</td><td>Ranger\n</td><td>1\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">+10% Health per END, +5 AGI and END, -5% Mana per INT, -5 STR and INT\n</td><td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Extra-crispy-monster-bait.png\" title=\"Image:Extra-crispy-monster-bait.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Extra-crispy-monster-bait.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Extra-crispy-monster-bait.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Crispy_Monster_Bait\" title=\"Extra Crispy Monster Bait\">Extra Crispy Monster Bait</a>\n</td><td>Ranger\n</td><td>1\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">+100% Monster Bait Health\n</td><td>31\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Poison-ward.png\" title=\"Image:Skill-_Poison-ward.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Skill-_Poison-ward.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Poison-ward.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Ward\" title=\"Poison Ward\">Poison Ward</a>\n</td><td>Ranger\n</td><td>15\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Raise Poison Resistance, Decrease ALL other resistances\n</td><td>30\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Trigger-happy.png\" title=\"Image:Trigger-happy.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Trigger-happy.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Trigger-happy.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Trigger_Happy\" title=\"Trigger Happy\">Trigger Happy</a>\n</td><td>Ranger\n</td><td>1\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">+25% Ranged Attack Speed, -7% Melee Attack Speed, -5% to all Magic damage\n</td><td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Bookworm.png\" title=\"Image:Bookworm.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Bookworm.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Bookworm.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Bookworm\" title=\"Bookworm\">Bookworm</a>\n</td><td>Mage\n</td><td>1\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">+100% Mana per INT, +5 END and INT, -25% Health per END, -5 STR and AGI\n</td><td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Couch-potato.png\" title=\"Image:Couch-potato.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Couch-potato.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Couch-potato.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Couch_Potato\" title=\"Couch Potato\">Couch Potato</a>\n</td><td>Mage\n</td><td>1\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">+20% Mana per INT, +5 STR and INT, -5% Health per END, -5 AGI and END\n</td><td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Fire-ward.png\" title=\"Image:Skill-_Fire-ward.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Skill-_Fire-ward.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Fire-ward.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Ward\" title=\"Fire Ward\">Fire Ward</a>\n</td><td>Mage\n</td><td>15\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Raise Fire Resistance, Decrease ALL other resistances\n</td><td>30\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Ice-ward.png\" title=\"Image:Skill-_Ice-ward.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Skill-_Ice-ward.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Ice-ward.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Ward\" title=\"Ice Ward\">Ice Ward</a>\n</td><td>Mage\n</td><td>15\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Raise Ice Resistance, Decrease ALL other resistances\n</td><td>30\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Improved-shadow-lightning.png\" title=\"Image:Improved-shadow-lightning.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Improved-shadow-lightning.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Improved-shadow-lightning.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Improved_Shadow_Lightning\" title=\"Improved Shadow Lightning\">Improved Shadow Lightning</a>\n</td><td>Mage\n</td><td>15\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Adds damage and chance to arc to Shadow Lightning\n</td><td>30\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Mental-prowess.png\" title=\"Image:Mental-prowess.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Mental-prowess.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Mental-prowess.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Mental_Prowess\" title=\"Mental Prowess\">Mental Prowess</a>\n</td><td>Mage\n</td><td>1\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">+20% to ALL Magic Damage, -7% Melee and Ranged Attack Speed\n</td><td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Shadow-ward.png\" title=\"Image:Skill-_Shadow-ward.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Skill-_Shadow-ward.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Shadow-ward.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Ward\" title=\"Shadow Ward\">Shadow Ward</a>\n</td><td>Mage\n</td><td>15\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Raise Shadow Resistance, Decrease ALL other resistances\n</td><td>30\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Bling-gnome.png\" title=\"Image:Bling-gnome.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Bling-gnome.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Bling-gnome.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Bling_Gnome\" title=\"Bling Gnome\">Bling Gnome</a>\n</td><td>All\n</td><td>1\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">An item converting <a href=\"/wiki/Bling_Gnome\" title=\"Bling Gnome\">Bling Gnome</a> follows you around.  Activate skill to have gnome convert items to gold.\n</td><td>N/A\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
